# ── Split-deploy note ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo ships TWO deployment modes:
#
#   A. Docker monolith (Render only)   — FastAPI serves the built frontend
#      at the same origin; VITE_API_URL MUST be empty (same-origin calls).
#
#   B. Split deploy (Vercel + Render)  — Vercel hosts the SPA; Render hosts
#      the backend at a different domain. VITE_API_URL MUST be set to the
#      Render service URL in the Vercel dashboard:
#
#        Settings → Environment Variables → VITE_API_URL
#          = https://ai-automation-studio.onrender.com
#
#      Also set EXTRA_CORS_ORIGINS on Render to the Vercel domain:
#        EXTRA_CORS_ORIGINS=https://ai-automation-studio-kohl.vercel.app
#
# NEVER put backend secrets (SESSION_SECRET, DATABASE_URL, API keys, …)
# into VITE_* variables — they are baked into the browser bundle at build
# time and become fully public.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Mode A (Docker monolith): leave empty — API is the same origin as the UI.
# Mode B (Vercel split-deploy): set in Vercel dashboard, NOT here.
VITE_API_URL=
